          {
            "name": "method",
            "values": [
              "cpa existing deep learning-based model | an alternative deep learning-based model used as a baseline for comparison.",
              "gears graph-enhanced gene activation and repression simulator | integrates deep learning with a knowledge graph of gene-gene relationships gene coexpression and gene ontology to predict transcriptional responses to single and multigene perturbations. uses distinct gene and perturbation embeddings a gnn to propagate information on graphs and a cross-gene mlp layer. trained using a bayesian formulation to output uncertainty. five models trained with different data splits for confidence intervals.",
              "gene regulatory network grn baseline adapted from celloracle | infers a gene regulatory network and linearly propagates effects of perturbing a gene along this network.",
              "no perturbation baseline | assumes perturbation results in no change in gene expression."
